    <string name="tc_ui_hangover_description">Run Windows apps using Hangover (running cross-arch apps on native Wine)!\n\nRunning Windows programs requires two layers of emulation (arch + system) - don\'t expect good performance!\n\nFor better speed, try enabling Graphics Acceleration. Crashes or failures are normal.\n\nRecommend moving Windows programs to desktop before running.\n\nBe patient. Even if GUI shows nothing. Check terminal - is it still running or stopped with error?\n\nOr check if the Windows app has official Linux arm64 version.</string>
